# GLib, target sysroot
### The GIRs of GLib (GLib-2.0, GObject-2.0, Gio-2.0...) are written by GLib itself with the
### g-ir-scanner of lfs/gobject-introspection, which is built against lfs/GLib:bootstrap: without the
### dependency a sysroot built from scratch got a GLib without them (introspection auto)
PKG_DEPS+=" lfs/gobject-introspection"
CONF_FLAGS+=" -Dintrospection=enabled"
